      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just as a note, I experienced this bug happens whenever the game freezes for a moment on crowded worlds as it's loading avatars, controller stops being tracked leaving my hands limp despite my controller is still working on the steamvr menu, only way to resolve it temporarily is closing steam completely and restarting it, but it happens again eventually",
